      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": ":Project \u00b7 :Catalog \u00b7 :Dataset \u00b7 :Column\n:DataContract \u00b7 :DProdColumn \u00b7 :DProdOutputDataset\n:PropertyShape \u00b7 :ColumnDescription \u00b7 :ColumnMapping\n:QualityScore \u00b7 :TestRun \u00b7 :TestResult\n:Activity \u00b7 :Entity  (PROV-O)\n\nVocabularies: DCAT-2 \u00b7 DQV \u00b7 SHACL-inspired \u00b7 PROV-O\nPersistent state of every agent action \u2014 read AND write.",
